    <string name="about_build_release">Ukukhishwa</string>
    <string name="about_blurb">I-Backlog Battlers ilandelela imidlalo onayo, ibala amaphuzu ezimpumelelo ozivulayo, futhi ikubeka ebhodini labaphambili lenyanga ubhekene nabangane bakho. Yakhiwe njengephrojekthi yephothifoliyo ye-PROG7314.</string>
    <string name="about_open_source">Amalayisensi omthombo ovulekile</string>
    <string name="about_terms_body">I-Backlog Battlers iyiphrojekthi yephothifoliyo yomfundi, inikezwa njengoba injalo futhi ngaphandle kwesiqinisekiso. Yisebenzise ukulandelela imidlalo yakho. Ungazami ukwenza mbumbulu izimpumelelo noma izindawo ebhodini labaphambili, futhi ungasebenzisi uhlelo ukuhlukumeza abanye abadlali. Ama-akhawunti enza noma yikuphi kwalokhu angasuswa. Ngoba lena inguqulo yomsebenzi wesifundo, izici zingashintsha noma zinyamalale phakathi kwezinguqulo, futhi asiqinisekisi ukuthi idatha izosinda uma ufaka kabusha uhlelo.</string>
    <string name="about_privacy_body">Ukungena nge-Google kunika uhlelo igama lakho elibonakalayo, ikheli le-imeyili nesithombe sephrofayela. Lokho, kanye nomtapo wakho, isikhathi sokudlala, izimpumelelo namaphuzu enyanga, kugcinwa kule divayisi nakuseva yephrojekthi ukuze indawo yakho ebhodini labaphambili inembe.\n\nIdatha yakho ayikaze ithengiswe noma yabelwe abakhangisi. Abangane bangabona igama lakho elibonakalayo, isithombe, amaphuzu nokwenzeke muva nje. Akekho ongabona ikheli lakho le-imeyili.\n\nUkuphuma kusula iseshini yakho kanye nekhophi yephrofayela yakho kule divayisi.</string>
    <string name="about_licences_body">Lolu hlelo lwakhiwe phezu komsebenzi womthombo ovulekile okhishwe ngaphansi kwe-Apache License 2.0:\n\n• AndroidX ne-Jetpack (Core, AppCompat, Activity, Fragment, Lifecycle, Navigation, Room, DataStore, Security, Credentials)\n• Material Components for Android\n• Kotlin Coroutines ne-kotlinx.serialization\n• Ktor Client\n\nImibhalo egcwele yamalayisensi iyatholakala endaweni yokugcina yephrojekthi ngayinye.</string>

